# <% .Name %>

The operator module of <% .Group %>/<% .Kind %> for Rigger: the object kind,
the ACL policy bound to the controller job and the controller job, applied as
one release (kind and policy first, the job last; uninstall in reverse
order).

```shell
rigger module validate ./module/<% .Name %>
rigger module render ./module/<% .Name %> -f ./module/<% .Name %>/examples/dev.vars.hcl
rigger install ./module/<% .Name %> -name <% .Name %>
rigger release status <% .Name %>
rigger release uninstall <% .Name %>
```

Keep `files/<% .KindLower %>.schema.json` in line with the one of the project: a
module reads no file outside its directory.
